  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access Bank is the largest bank in Nigeria by customer base and total assets, and it is committed to providing support to businesses through funding, capacity building and networking opportunities. Since 2018, we have provided direct and indirect investments to the bank supporting its ambitious expansion plans in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
